PARITY_COVERED=110

units (P1/S5): SI on the wire; the display boundary converts only at render — UnitFormatters.FormatTemperature
+ UnitConverters/UnitLabels for absolute temps, and a °F-aware delta (×1.8) for the temperature spread.
Voltages stay SI volts; imbalance/spread are millivolts as the web emits them. No non-SI is stored/computed.

a11y (ADR-015): AutomationProperties.SetName on the page, every TsMetricCard, every heatmap tile (with
ToolTip), the count badge, the data table, each chart, each insight card and each summary-stat panel;
a custom Group AutomationPeer; Fluent components carry built-in keyboard/pointer + light/dark via the
design tokens (Tokens.xaml). No hardcoded colors/typography — DisplayTokens / typography components only;
dynamic deviation colors route through StatusResources token brushes.

i18n (ADR-014): every visible literal resolves through ILocalizer (ShellLocalizer→Localization.Get in the
app; PassthroughLocalizer in tests). The battery.cells.* keys already exist in Strings/en/Resources.resw;
the plain-English keys fall back to their verbatim en-US default exactly as the web t(key, default) does.
The auto-generated resw was NOT hand-edited (no silent drift).

